window.products.push({"id":1080022,"name":"Zinus Night Therapy Memory Foam 4 Inch Pressure Relief Mattress Topper, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31wko9unWOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Sleep better tonight with the Night Therapy Memory Foam Mattress Topper by Zinus. Luxurious fiber quilted top layer with memory foam mid layer to comfort and support. Pressure Relieving Comfort Foam is the base layer that eliminates pressure points. The latest evolution of memory foam, BioFoam replaces some of the traditional petroleum with natural plant oil, includes natural green tea extract, and all-natural active charcoal to help absorb moisture, eliminate odors, and keep your mattress fresh. Please open your mattress topper package within 72 hours of receipt and allow 48 hours for your new topper to return to its original, plush shape. Another comfort innovation from Zinus. Pioneering comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31wko9unWOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B003GEFXAE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003GEFXAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003GEFXAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
