window.products.push({"id":1080108,"name":"Vtopmart 2 Pack Paper Towel Holders, Self-Adhesive or Wall Mount Black Paper Towel Holders for Kitchen, Under Cabinet and Under Counter, Hanging Stain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NrYrLDqWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Space Saving] Hanging horizontally or vertically is available for paper towel holders to help you organize a cluttered kitchen and make effective use of your space. The towel holder can be attached to a wall or cabinet to collect large rolls of paper, plastic wrap, towels, cooking utensils, etc. [Sturdy & Durable] The cabinet towel holder is made of stainless steel, which prevents rust and deformity, extending its durability. The adhesive sticker is firm enough to hold the weight of the item by 4.4 pounds after 24 HOURS of adhesion. You could also opt for drilling, which is more stable and tolerates a total of 11 pounds. [2 Ways to Install] The paper towel rack can be installed either in an adhesive or a drilling manner, both of which are super easy to assemble and do not take you as much time. Only need to peel off the films or drill 2 holes for it. You can choose the most appropriate installation for your wall material. Adhesion is suitable for smooth surfaces and drilling for rough surfaces. [Wide of Use] Adhesive paper towel holders can be installed under cabinets or wall mounts in your kitchen, bathroom, cupboard, RV, laundry room, office, pantry, craft room, etc. ​In addition to paper towels, tissues, plastic wrap, you can also hang your shower ball on this holder. [Simple & Matt Design] The wall mount paper towel holder is designed with a matt finish that creates a sleek and chic look for this holder. Black and simple holders are great for all styles of home decor, bringing a funky vibe to your kitchen and bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NrYrLDqWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vtopmart","source_asin":"B0B4RHQG1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4RHQG1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4RHQG1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
