window.products.push({"id":1080128,"name":"All-Clad Textiles Fire-Resistant Heavyweight Cotton Twill Oven Mitt with Non-Slip Silicone Grip and Reinforced Thumb, 500°F Heat Threshold, Cornflower","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZIeAPsSFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The All-Clad Premium Collection Non-Slip 100% Cotton Twill Oven Mitt. Made from durable 100% cotton with a strong anti-slip 100% silicone treatment, this oven mitt will protect you from extreme temperatures in the kitchen. Measuring 13-inches long, the textured silicone face provides solid non-slip grip while also adding an extra layer protection and durability. Features: Added Protection. Protect your forearms when reaching into a hot oven or grill with this 13\" long oven mitt. Right and Left Hand Compatible. This oven mitt is constructed with a universal shape to fit both right and left hands comfortably. Non-Slip Grip. The textured non-slip silicone treatment helps to lock objects in place. Quilted Lining. Added comfort and protection with this 100% Cotton Terry lining. 500°F Heat Threshold. Extreme temperature protection from below freezing up to 500°F. Easy Care. Machine wash and tumble dry low. Measurements. 13-inches long (33-centimeters). Why Ritz? Established in 1892, the John Ritzenthaler company (Ritz) has long been synonymous with the finest quality in home textiles. Today, the John Ritzenthaler company is a privately owned manufacturer, wholesaler and distributor of a complete line of high quality, color coordinated, fashion basic and designer bath and kitchen textiles, as well as, specialty laundry and cleaning aids. As a leader in the home textiles category we are experienced in working on Ritz initiated design concepts, licensed designs and also with interpreting customer requests into new products. Our marketing and design teams work closely together to identify product opportunities within the marketplace to help create the right product mix for our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZIeAPsSFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B00UABRMI2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UABRMI2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UABRMI2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
