window.products.push({"id":1080289,"name":"7 Pieces Replacement for Nutri Bullet Blender 32oz Cup and Extractor Blade with 2 Rubber Gasket, Compatible with Nutribullet 600W/900W Models","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S4lUYVlfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[COMPATIBLE]: The replacement parts are compatible with Nutri bullet 600W and 900W, NOT compatible with Nutri Bullet Lean (1200 watts) or Nutri Bullet RX (1700 watts) accessories - NOT compatible with Magic Bullet or Ninja blenders. [WHAT YOU GET]: 2 x 32oz cup, 2 x extractor blade, 2 x rubber gasket and 1 cup cleaning brush as a gift [REPLACEMENT]: By being built for a frequent user and to last a lifetime, this replacement cup will help you create your favorite fruit drinks, smoothies, protein shakes, and anything else. Dishwasher safe, extract and blend in the same cup. > [PREMIUM QUALITY]: The blade is made of food grade plastic and high strength stainless steel. The blade gasket is made of food grade silicone material. The blade is sharp and firm. The cup mouth is scratch resistant and not fragile. The gasket is tight and sealed well without leakage. Direct replacement, easy installation. >[GUARANTEE AND SERVICE]: The Cup and Extractor Blade comes complete with a One-year Warranty. Save much money off dealer prices. If the fuse ever failure on your dryer, simply contact us for a replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S4lUYVlfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DRELD","source_asin":"B09WH3M3YV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WH3M3YV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WH3M3YV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1080290,"name":"JV16 Egg Mold Ring Pancake Nonstick Stainless Steel Set of 5PCS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IHDvCViSL._AC_SL1256_.jpg","description":"How often do you hear “NOT AGAIN” from you significant other or from you kids when you serve them breakfast? Providing variety breakfast is a challenge and can be daunting if you don’t have the right tools to keep their interest for breakfast flaming. Introducing the supreme quality stainless steel egg and pancake mold from the JV16 lineup. This well designed egg mold will help making breakfast a breeze. Picking from the 5 different shapes you can introduce variety for every week day and bring a smile to your partner or kids. A healthy breakfast is a good way to start the day and nothing spells BETTER than our 5 piece egg/pancake molds. You don’t have to be a CHEF to learn how to make well shaped healthy eggs for your breakfast. Just follow these simple instructions. Step 1: Pour a little oil onto a nonstick pan and set the egg mold down on the pan Step 2: It will be a good idea to coat the mold edges with butter or edible oil Step 3: Break open the egg right in the center of the mold. Make sure your pan and the mold have been heated before adding eggs. Step 4: To make sure the egg is properly cooked and ready wiggle the mold and if the ring begins to pull away with ease, then it is done. Step 5: Enjoy your delicious breakfast with your loved ones. NB: To get a more firm shape and to avoid leaks press the handle of the mold when pouring the egg or pancake mixture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IHDvCViSL._AC_SL1256_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JV16","source_asin":"B07DBYLF48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DBYLF48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DBYLF48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
