window.products.push({"id":1080327,"name":"BEKATA Black Flying Birds Modern Metal Wall Art Décor for Living Room and Housewarming Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DBarpsu2L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Your guests are sure to be pleased with your new modern metal birds wall art being the first thing they see in a room! Display it over a sofa or bed to create a sense of exploration, or, in an entryway to welcome adventure and inspire it on your way out. Easy to hang and looks amazing on top of patterned wallpaper, deep tonal paints and white walls alike. Whether you take a new route to work or buy a spontaneous plane ticket we love the adventurer in you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DBarpsu2L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bekata","source_asin":"B0845T85RB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0845T85RB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0845T85RB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1080328,"name":"INKWASH Giclee Prints Xu Beihong Chinese Horse Painting 3 Wild Galloping Running Horses Wall Art Decor Feng Shui Horse Success Symbol for Home Office ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VjOInGyUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Beautiful Find This Chinese horse painting,treated by the advanced giclee simulation technology,has perfectly being restored back to its original style and spirit.It also has the highest artistic quality after the traditional 100% hand-making mounting. Abount This Painting and the Painter Xu Beihong (1895-1953),is a founder of the contemporary art industry of China and an outstanding painter and art educator.He referenced the classical realistic painting of the west and advocated the reform of Chinese paintings according to realistic principles.He emphasized similarity to the real objects with the depiction of meticulous details.In particular,his theory of \"sketch is the base of all profile arts\" generated an epoch-making effect in the history of painting and declared the end to the time-honored color-filling painting mode advocated by historic masters from Gu Kaizhi to Ren Bonian and the creation of a new-generation Chinese painting. His advocating on painting style is merged with the \"socialist realism\" of the Soviet Union,hence creating the largest mainstream painting genre in the 19th century.His representative work of \"Galloping Horses\" is the most popular one.He also painted flowers,birds and cats in a unique and interesting style.The Horse galloping across the battlefield symbolizes the hero who protects his home and defends his country,punishes evil-doers,and fights for justice.The spirit of the Horse is faithfulness, speediness, nobleness, and the inability to be conquered. ABOUT US INKWASH is the most professional Chinese painting and calligraphy artwork promoter in Northern America and enjoys diversified artwork promotion channels,including network art city,galleries and exhibition halls.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VjOInGyUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INKWASH","source_asin":"B019Q47BNO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019Q47BNO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019Q47BNO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
