window.products.push({"id":1080389,"name":"jinchan Linen Valance Curtain Gray Floral Tie Up Valance 20 Inch for Kitchen Living Room Farmhouse Botanic Design Window Decor Light Filtering Rod Poc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o0Dlw6H9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ready Made: 1 panel tie up valance, W50 x L20 for one panel. Our flax linen valance curtains feature 3 inch high pole pocket to coordinate with most standard curtain rods. Two adjustable ties with 3 snaps are easy to adjust length. It is recommended to use a rod with a diameter of 1.5 inch or less. Floral Printed Tie Up Shade: Frame your window with JINCHAN botanic valance window treatments. Graceful floral pattern on linen-poly blend fabric creates a sense of freshness and elegance, adding natural and peaceful ambiance to your room, easily matching your existing interior decor. Light Filtering: Our tie up curtains diffuse excessive light while offering some privacy, making them the perfect light-filtering window curtains. Enjoy the cozy time by enjoying the soft light inside. Lightweight & breathable fabrics are suitable for use throughout the home. Versatile Farmhouse Valance: Dress up your home window with our mindfully made valance. Not only are these tie up valances suitable for the living room area, but also a perfect addition to your study, bedroom, bathroom and basement window. Be creative with JINCHAN curtains! Easy Care: These farmhouse swag ties curtains are durable with sturdy fabric and top-notch stitching. Machine washable in cold water in gentle circle and tumble dry on low. Do not bleach. The crease can be pressed by ironing and steaming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o0Dlw6H9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jinchan","source_asin":"B0BGX2NFP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGX2NFP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGX2NFP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1080390,"name":"Wall Decor 1908 Angel Flight Railway Vintage Black and White Art Print Poster (16x20)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GXm9zLXiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you feel empty and lonely by viewing your dull walls then refill our surrounding with railway poster. The two Angels flight railway cars have been here in Los Angeles since 1901. That rebuilding was in connection with col. Eddy’s constructing a trestle over Clay Street so the cars would be going up a constant grade. Clay Street is only a memory now. The city of Los Angeles removed much of the railway’s old neighborhood-actually, the entire old neighborhood except from angels. The addition of a new station house and the hill street arch in 1908. Angel’s flight passed to its second private owners in 1912. So what are you waiting for? Hurry up! Buy this poster for its superb quality and high quality and high degree of color accuracy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GXm9zLXiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impact Posters Gallery","source_asin":"B01BGNBZSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BGNBZSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BGNBZSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
