window.products.push({"id":1080461,"name":"KEAFOLS Mulberry Silk Pillowcase for Hair Skin Queen Size, Both Side 19 Momme Silk 600TC 100% Pure Silk Pillow Case with Hidden Zipper, Soft Breathabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51daHxJXk+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【100% MULBERRY SILK】: KEAFOLS's silk pillow cases with hidden zipper design utilizes silk to provide slippery feel with a distinctive and lustrous appearance. The tiny molecules emitted by 18 kinds of amino acids can make people's nerves in a more stable state and promote sleep quality. Queen size 20x30 inches fits most queen pillow. 【HAIR CARE】: Silk pillowcases are more slick which reduces friction and causes less pulling of your hair. This means less tangles, bed head and breakage than sleeping on cotton pillowcases - KEAFOLS slip silky pillowcases prevent hair from becoming knotted and matted and help your shiny hair retain moisture, perfect for curly hair. 【ANTI-AGING】: Silk is nonabsorbent, the silk pillowcase helps keep your face hydrated! The more hydrated your skin is, the less noticeable facial wrinkles. Great for anti-aging, perfect for sensitive skin. 【NATURAL TEMPERATURE REGULATOR】: Silk naturally regulates heat, which helps you maintain the correct body temperature. It doesn’t conduct heat, so if you want to keep cool at night on hot days, go with silk pillowcase. On the flip side, it retains heat during cold weather. 【WHAT YOU GET】: 1PCS silk pillowcase and 100 night’s money back service. We suggest to buy 2 or more. As it is a luxurious present for you and lover keeping young. Your friend or lover will fall in love with this silk pillow cover. Perfect for Thanksgiving, Christmas, Birthday, Mother’s Day, Valentine’s Day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51daHxJXk+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEAFOLS","source_asin":"B08CTYYL5P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CTYYL5P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CTYYL5P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
