window.products.push({"id":1080611,"name":"Henckels 31037-233 Pro S Bread Knife 9-in.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21EDWBMBY2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description J.A. Henckels has been manufacturing top quality knives since its founding in Solingen, Germany, more than 260 years ago. Simple, heavy duty and functional, all Henckels knives are made from high carbon, no-stain steel and crafted using the FRIODUR ice-hardening process for maximum blade strength and a long-lasting sharp edge. Knives in the Professional Series feature a triple riveted Novadur handle with fully visible tang construction for proper balance and great strength. Dishwasher safe. Materials Handle: Polypropylene Blade: Stainless Steel Cleaning and Care Dishwasher Safe Amazon.com From the classically designed handles to the razor-sharp blades, from the perfectly balanced weight to the comfortable hand feel, what's not to like about Henckels Professional S knives? As with all great cutlery, Henckels Pro S knives slice through vegetables, breads, and meats like they were melted butter. This Pro S 9-inch country bread knife features a serrated edge that can smartly cut through hard breads, such as baguettes, or soft breads without damaging the crust or squishing the loaf. Pro S cutlery is particularly durable (and corrosion-resistant) because of its ice-hardened stainless-steel construction. In addition, the knives are honed by laser to the optimum cutting angle, from the tip to the bolster. Fear not when making your own bread loaves or buying from the bakery--this knife will slice with the fine-edged efficiency of a professional. It's also dishwasher-safe. --Rivers Janssen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21EDWBMBY2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENCKELS","source_asin":"B0000632SR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000632SR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000632SR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
