window.products.push({"id":1080684,"name":"10-Cup Drip Coffee Maker, Grind and Brew Automatic Coffee Machine with Built-In Burr Coffee Grinder, Programmable Timer Mode and Keep Warm Plate, 1.5L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AjW1ri6ML._AC_SL1420_.jpg","description":"☕ 【1.5L LARGE CAPACITY】: The Grind Coffee Machine can brew up to 10 cups coffee. Set the number of coffee powder (2,4,6,8,10) through press \" CUP 2-10 \" button in the control panel base on your own needs. If not, the default number of cup is 10 cups.【NOTE: when making coffee, the amount of coffee powder added should correspond to the amount of water, otherwise it will affect the coffee concentration.】 ☕ 【EASY TO OPERATE】: Depending on your personal preference, choose coffee beans or coffee powder to make drip coffee. The coffee machine is equipped with a burr grinder, so you can brew a cup of fresh coffee with coffee beans. The coffee beans are gathered and ground by the burr grinder, retain the full flavor of the beans, then the coffee powder will fall directly on the filter. ☕ 【OPTIMUM FLAVOR THROUGH BREWING SETTINGS】: With 3 strength control settings and 8 coffee grind control grade, create your desired drink. A conical burr grinder lets you choose from 8 grade, from coarse to fine, for the best results by bean type and desired drink. Three settings deliver coffee just the way you like it, with a choice of strong, medium, or mild for flavor customized to your taste. Press the \"GRIND OFF\" button if you need the coffee machine to stop grinding coffee powder. ☕ 【AUTOMATIC START FUNCTION】: Entering the timer mode and setting the time you wanted to automatic start, the programmable timer will preset the machine start time and start brewing coffee at the specified time. There is a prompt bell after brewing. It helps to save time making coffee in the morning. After brewing, there is a warming plate design that the coffee can be warmed in the carafe lasts for 60 minutes. ☕ 【WARRANTY & SERVICE】: Consumers will get TWO-YEAR warranty of this Brew and Grind Coffee Machine. If you have any problem of this machine, please feel free to contact with us, we will give you the best solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AjW1ri6ML._AC_SL1420_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barsetto","source_asin":"B08HQH2HXQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HQH2HXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HQH2HXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
