window.products.push({"id":1080728,"name":"Hugs Gift Throw Blanket -100×70 cm- Cozy Lightweight Thick Blanket - All Seasons Suitable for Women, Men and Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c+v+MPSsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of 100% microfiber polyester, plush and fluffy, it gives you a light and breathable feeling. This high-quality wool blanket warms you while providing you with a soft and gentle . It is durable and can be used for a long time. Does not shed hair. Can't afford the ball. Easily match existing bedding or home decor. Just hang it on the end of a chair, sofa, sofa or bed, it will be a great home decoration. Multipurpose: When reading on a chair, cover your knees and legs with our flannel blanket, surrounded by a soft blanket, drink a cup of tea in the cold morning, take a comfortable nap in the afternoon, and on movie night.This blanket feels like the perfect companion, perfect for hanging out at home. It is also very suitable for outdoor use, camping, road trip or road essentials for travel lovers. The perfect gift: Exquisite packaging with elegant gift ribbons, it is a great gift choice for boys, girls, friends and family. The perfect gift for Christmas, Valentine's Day, birthday, and housewarming. It can also be used as a pet blanket, a great gift for your cats and dogs. When you snuggle on a comfortable blanket, you may not be able to tell them which one likes it better. Easy to care: machine wash gently with cold water and similar colored clothing. Note: Do not bleach. Dry at low temperature. Do not iron. Do not dry clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c+v+MPSsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YIoyiY","source_asin":"B0BB2RMKLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB2RMKLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB2RMKLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1080729,"name":"Sunland Artisans 4in Long Smooth Bear Figurine Ironwood Carving - Lodge Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jGjJu1SJL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"This detailed figurine is carved from Sonoran desert ironwood, an extremely hard and heavy wood that is most difficult to carve. Our 4in long smooth bear hand-carved North American olneya ironwood figurine measures 2 inches high x 4 inches long x 2 inches wide (approximately). The precise measurements may be slightly different as each is hand crafted. The amazing tree from which this item is crafted is a wonder of nature. Olneya tesota, also known as ironwood, gets its name from its extreme hardness and weight. This wood is very difficult to work, but patient traditional artists from northern Mexico carefully carve and etch this medium to reveal incredible detail. Subsequent sanding and polishing bring out the rich, deep grain and personality of the wood. The result is a very shiny and smooth hard finish remarkably achieved with no lacquer or varnish. This product is quite durable as well. Because of its great density, it is resistant to water, scratches and stains. This makes it easy to clean with a damp cloth. It can also be treated now and then with paste shoe polish and a light buffing to give this art piece a rich shine and bring out the intricate detail of the wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jGjJu1SJL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunland Artisans","source_asin":"B07B8XCH3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B8XCH3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B8XCH3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
