window.products.push({"id":1080794,"name":"Whiskey Stones Gift Set for Men, Guys, Husband, Fathers Set of 2 10oz Whiskey Rocks Glasses, 8 Granite Chilling Rocks, 2 Slate Coasters, Stylish Durab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlAeHLgnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅WONDERFUL GIFT ITEM FOR YOUR WHISKEY FRIENDS: This whiskey glass is the perfect whiskey stones gift set for your friends who enjoy a great glass of whiskey. With its elegant and strong look, it is also of the best design and craftsmanship. It holds eight whiskey stones, comes with tongs and a variety of different glasses for you to choose from! There are also two coasters for your use, to make sure your surface never stains. ✅NO MORE WATERED DOWN WHISKEY: For whiskey on the rocks, there is nothing worse than a watered down drink! You always have to drink faster than the ice melts, unable to enjoy your expensive whiskey! Fear no more, keep your drink cool, and take the time to enjoy your favorite drink with our 8 individual whiskey stones. ✅MACHINE WASH SAFE: Feel free to put all of our products in your dishwasher without any fear of them breaking. The whiskey stones will not absorb any water and will keep the structural integrity of your stones safe. The glasses are also safe to go in the dishwasher as well. ✅STRONG BLACK AND SILVER CASE: This black and silver case not only looks amazing, it is built with fantastic craftsmanship. It's simple sleek black look, compiled with its elegant whiskey glasses, makes for the perfect gift or to simply display on your home bar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlAeHLgnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Highball & Chaser","source_asin":"B0B1CM5TCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1CM5TCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1CM5TCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1080795,"name":"Woven Laundry Basket 15.7”X15.7”,EMPEROR 13.3 Gal Large Cotton Rope Blanket Basket Boho Nursery Hamper For Living Room Bedroom (Black & White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Laz79RCgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Soft But Sturdy】--The tall laundry hamper is woven from 100% natural cotton rope,breathable and eco-friendly. The thick cotton material makes the tall basket sturdy enough to stand well by itself even when empty.The soft touch is perfect for nursery and baby home use, and will not scratch the kids and the floor. 【Reinforced Long Handles】--The large blanket basket is equipped with a strong long handle,you can easily carry the clothes hamper up and down with one hand for maximum portability.When carrying heavy clothes and blankets,you can also with the easy-grip handles on both sides for easily transport.The soft rope handle doesn’t hurt your hand and heavy duty. 【Tall Design With Large Capacity】--The cotton rope basket size:15.7”D x 15.7”H,the round rope laundry basket is big enough to store a week's clothes,or hold 3-4 large blankets,or 2-4 yoga mats,or 3-4 throw pillows,or 18-20 pairs of shoes or a lot baby toys, books,holiday decorations etc.This large hamper basket is perfect for a unique baby shower gift basket for large items! 【Collapsible & Flexible Design】--Simple black and white color scheme,make the boho laundry basket provide a nice fine Nordic touch/farmhouse style to any room of the house.You can put it in living room, bedroom, laundromat, nursery,baby room or dorm room. It's easy to fold up to store when you not use. You can also fold down the top to fit your closet if you need. 【Great Gift For Family】--The elegant boho style, soft touch and large capacity ,all this make the tall woven basket a favorite among family members, it can help mom tidy and decorate the home, help dad storage his tools, and help storage a lot of toys for kids or pets.everybody needs such a tall storage basket,it’s a wonderful present for your mother,sister,daughter,etc. and great gift for baby shower,mother's day, birthday,etc. 【How To Shape The Woven Basket】--The boho hamper is shipped folded,there need some contribution to reshape the rope basket. There are two ways-The one is to fulfill the basket with large blankets,plush toys or pillows 24-48 hours to reshape. The other is ironing 5-10 min to reshape immediately. 【Excellent After-Service】-- This cotton rope basket is durable and dirt resistant,washable and sun-dried.please machine wash with caution!Please feel free to contact us if you have any problems about the laundry basket. We offer refund service to help you get a great shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Laz79RCgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emperor","source_asin":"B09X11NRB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X11NRB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X11NRB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
