window.products.push({"id":1080933,"name":"Charger Plate Large 13.5” Decorative Glass Service Plate for Home Or Professional Fine Dining -For Upscale Catering Events, Dinner Parties, Weddings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1XeDP5EtNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take your tablescape to new levels of sophistication. Whether you’re hosting an intimate dinner party or glamorous upscale event, these Charger Plates from ChargeIt by Jay offer amazing convenience. Blending high-end decorative appeal with the practicality of a placemat, each charger catches guests’ minor messes and spills throughout the evening. Use them to display name cards, menus, napkin rings and other elegant accessories before placing courses atop their spacious 13” surface area. Available in a variety of colors, materials and styles, the collection brings beautiful, durable hospitality to every dinner service. ChargeIt by Jay delivers unique gifts, supplies and collectibles crafted with the time-honored techniques and long-lasting materials of yesteryear. Upgrade your event with our vast lineup of premium serveware and other artful accessories, and purchase confidently knowing your treasures always arrive in peak condition. Once they do, you’ll be entertaining in style. Add some Charger Plates to your cart today! What You Get: 1 x Charger Plate from ChargeIt by Jay A gorgeous platter to stylize your setting Mealtime class as a matter of course! Specs & Details: Quantity: 1 Surface diameter: 13.5” Material: Glass Use: Indoor and outdoor Color: Silver Care: Wash and dry by hand Note: For decorative use only How to Enjoy: Place a charger at the center of each place setting Decorate the table with complementary flowers and fabrics Set each course on top to keep your tablecloth clean Behold guests’ admiration of your thoughtful tablescape!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1XeDP5EtNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChargeIt by Jay","source_asin":"B00EAYZH1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EAYZH1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EAYZH1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1080934,"name":"Robin Good (VeggieTales) - DVD","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W1Q8SEGEL._AC_.jpg","description":"A long time ago, in the faraway town of Bethlingham, roved a band of merry men, led by the fearless Robin Good. Their mission: to help people by fundraising from the rich and giving to the poor! But when a greedy Prince starts stealing the townspeople's hams, donations are down and Robin's friends take off and decide to give robbing from the rich a try. Feeling rejected, Robin thinks things can't get any worse, until he finds out that the ham-hoarding Prince has also captured his friends. Can Robin overcome his own hurt, rescue his friends and restore the townspeople's hope? Find out in this fun Veggie story where kids learn that no hurt is too big!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W1Q8SEGEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Capitol Christian Distribution","source_asin":"B00DWGJNTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1080934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DWGJNTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DWGJNTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
